        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 5.3m x 3.5m (max measurement)\nwith hardwood floor, double height ceiling, recessed downlighting and oak staircase.\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - \n\n\nKitchen - 3.3m x 2.5m\nwith tiled floor, recessed down lighting, fitted with a range of floor and eye level units, Hotpoint stainless-steel oven with five-ring gas hob, stainless-steel hood over, Neff integrated dishwasher, one and a half bowl stainless-steel sink unit and window to the front.\n\nBreakfast Area - 4.8m x 7m (max measurements)\nwith tiled floors, recessed downlighting, centre island, window to the front, French doors to the rear, French doors leading through to\n\nInner Lobby - \n\n\nLiving Room - 4.6m x 4.7m (max measurements)\nlocated to the front of the property, with recessed downlighting, ceiling coving, stone fireplace with gas fire inset, window to the front and side.\n\nUtility Room - 2.8m x 3.2m\nwith tiled floor, range of eye and floor level units, stainless-steel sink unit, tiled splashback, plumbed for washing machine, hatch to attic, door to rear garden, boiler located here, fuseboard and door to garden.\n\nGuest WC - \nwith tiled floor, tiled walls, pedestal wash hand basin, wc, wall mounted mirror, recessed downlighting and frosted window to the side\n\nDining Room - 3.4m x 5.6m\nlocated to the rear, with hardwood floor, ceiling coving and French doors to rear garden.\n\nDrawing Room - 4.5m x 7.6m (max measurements into bay window)\nwith hardwood floor, ceiling coving, recessed downlighting, stone fireplace with gas fire inset, window to the side and bay window to the rear.\n\nStudy - 2.9m x 3.3m (max measurements)\nlocated to the front with hardwood floors and recessed downlighting.\n\nGuest WC - \nwith hardwood floor, tiled walls, pedestal wash hand basin, wc, Xpel Air and recessed downlighting.\n\nUpstairs - \nGallery landing with window to the front, recessed downlighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 4.3m (max measurements)\nlocated to the rear, with recessed downlighting, archway through to\n\nInner Hallway - \noff which there is a walk-in closet with hanging and shelving.\n\nEnsuite - \nwith tiled floor, fully tiled walls, vanity wash hand bain with storage underneath, wall mounted, mirror, bath, wc, heated towel rail, fully tiled step-in shower, window to the front.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.5m\nlocated to the rear with built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 4.5m\nlocated to the rear with built in wardrobes and door to\n\nEnsuite - \nwith fully tiled floors and walls, pedestal wash hand basin, wc, wall mounted mirror, heated towel rail, frosted window to the side, fully tiled step-in shower and Xpel Air.\n\nBathroom - \nwith fully tiled floors and walls, recessed downlighting, fully tiled step-in corner shower, wc, jacuzzi bath, oversized vanity wash hand basin, mirrored medicine cabinet, heated towel rail and frosted window to the side.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.9m x 2.8m\nlocated to the front with built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3m x 4m\nlocated to the front with built in wardrobes.\n\nAttic Room - 15m x 3.3m (max measurements)\nwith pitch pine timber floorboards, velux roof lights, doors to undereaves storage.\n\nDetached Garage - 5.8m x 6.6m\nlocated to the rear is a detached brick garage with slate tiled roof and up and over door.\n\n"
